@baseUrl = http://localhost:5237
@bookingId = REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID
@bookingToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### List car slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/slots?floor=F02&status=AVAILABLE&pageSize=20

### Guest booking (enable Features:GuestBookings in User Secrets first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plate": "51A-12345",
  "vehicleType": "CAR",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "slotId": "F02-A0001"
}

### Read own booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
X-Booking-Token: {{bookingToken}}

### Cancel own booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
X-Booking-Token: {{bookingToken}}
